00:05:54.551 --> 00:05:57.378
These were some methods of 'Tuple'
which I want to explain to you

00:05:58.119 --> 00:06:02.639
You can use all methods of 'Lists' once you
converted a 'Tuple' to a 'List'

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:06.533
And then make the changes wanted to make

00:06:06.748 --> 00:06:08.814
Then convert it again to the 'Tuple

00:06:09.287 --> 00:06:13.227
As long as it'll remain in the state of 'Tuple'
You won't be able to change it

00:06:13.452 --> 00:06:15.899
But when you converted it into a 'List' from
a 'Tuple' then you can make changes

00:06:16.043 --> 00:06:18.936
Then after making changes if you
convert it again to a 'Tuple'

00:06:19.093 --> 00:06:22.333
Then you cannot make change
in existing 'Tuple'

00:06:22.614 --> 00:06:24.898
Because 'Tuples' are immutable

